  "description": "Des de Newenergies Petrocat, distribuïm els millors productes amb el segell de qualitat Repsol.",
  "longDescription": "Newenergies Petrocat is a leading distributor of high-quality energy products, proudly offering Repsol-branded solutions across Tarragona and Southern Barcelona. Committed to delivering excellence, Newenergies Petrocat specializes in a wide range of products and services tailored for various sectors. They provide domestic heating oil, fuel for generators, and agricultural machinery, ensuring customers receive reliable and efficient energy sources. \n\nTheir offerings include Petrocat Diesel e+, Agrodiesel e+10, Energy e+, TechnoDiesel, and Adblue products, all designed to meet specific operational needs and minimize environmental impact. Newenergies Petrocat is dedicated to exceptional service, featuring rapid delivery within 24 hours and personalized assistance for both residential and industrial clients. They also support businesses with competitive pricing and no hidden costs.\n\nFurthermore, customers can switch to renewable electricity and take advantage of financing options for fuel purchases. With a focus on quality and customer satisfaction, Newenergies Petrocat strives to bring the best energy solutions directly to homes and businesses.",
